WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:45.040 --> 01:46.330
<i>I'm sorry, Maron.</i>

01:46.330 --> 01:49.830
<i>It's okay, I don't need anybody's help.</i>

01:53.130 --> 01:54.260
<i>I'm sorry, Maron.</i>

01:54.260 --> 01:58.380
<i>It's okay, I can live by myself.</i>

02:00.550 --> 02:03.560
<i>I'm okay. I'm strong.</i>

02:21.030 --> 02:22.240
A dream...

02:22.950 --> 02:24.660
Why now?

02:30.830 --> 02:34.840
<i>It's a model of your father's best-designed amusement park.</i>

02:35.960 --> 02:37.840
<i>Maron...Dome...</i>

02:39.050 --> 02:44.100
<i>Why did he name it after me?</i>

02:45.140 --> 02:47.850
<i>There is no parent who doesn't feel this way.</i>

02:50.140 --> 02:53.230
This is gonna be a good day!

03:00.450 --> 03:07.120
The Day "Energetic and Courageous" Was Broken

03:24.970 --> 03:29.810
What's up with Maron? She's trying to improve all by herself.

03:29.810 --> 03:32.520
She should at least invite me to practice with her.

03:34.020 --> 03:34.940
Good morning!

03:34.940 --> 03:37.780
Chiaki, good morning!

03:37.780 --> 03:38.530
Where's Maron?

03:40.530 --> 03:42.530
She said she had to leave early.

03:44.740 --> 03:47.030
She was talking about being the star of Momokuri Academy.

03:47.030 --> 03:48.040
Star?

03:50.330 --> 03:54.040
<i>My goal from today on is to become the star of Momokuri Academy!</i>

03:54.040 --> 03:57.340
<i>So I've got to go early and start practicing.</i>

04:13.230 --> 04:17.820
How wonderful that you've come in early to practice!

04:17.820 --> 04:24.820
<i>Sensei, I now know that there is no one in the world who's not needed!</i>

04:26.530 --> 04:28.410
I'm so moved!

04:28.410 --> 04:31.830
<i>So I'll put everything into gymnastics...</i>

04:31.830 --> 04:34.420
...and become the star of Momokuri!

04:45.430 --> 04:50.010
The next target is inside a statue in the museum... The "Goddess of Greece."

04:51.220 --> 04:52.230
Are you ready?

04:52.230 --> 04:53.520
Okay, Fin!

05:05.450 --> 05:07.820
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

05:15.040 --> 05:16.920
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

05:16.920 --> 05:18.710
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

05:18.710 --> 05:20.250
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

05:47.950 --> 05:49.240
In the name of God...

06:03.550 --> 06:07.050
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

06:12.510 --> 06:14.220
I seal you here!

06:16.930 --> 06:18.810
<i>Checkmate!</i>

06:26.240 --> 06:27.070
Is it Jeanne?!

06:31.740 --> 06:33.740
<i>Collection completed!</i>

06:37.830 --> 06:40.630
Damn! She got away again!

06:41.920 --> 06:45.090
Tonight, I've taken yet another deceptive beauty!

06:46.050 --> 06:46.920
Maron!

06:54.930 --> 06:56.350
It can't be...

07:02.650 --> 07:04.820
Good work! How was it?

07:04.820 --> 07:09.950
Piece of cake! I'm in invincibility mode right now!

07:09.950 --> 07:13.990
Way to go! Maron is finally accepting her role!

07:24.380 --> 07:29.300
<i>- No one is available to take the call right now.</i>

07:27.340 --> 07:29.300
- The phone! Be right there!

07:29.300 --> 07:31.630
<i>Please leave a message:</i>

07:34.300 --> 07:35.930
I'll be right there!

07:35.930 --> 07:38.140
<i>Maron-chan? This is Mom.</i>

07:52.030 --> 07:55.240
You haven't been doing very well lately.

07:55.240 --> 07:56.830
What's wrong?

07:56.830 --> 08:00.120
You were injured trying to help Jeanne, but that was some time ago.

08:00.120 --> 08:02.830
Wait! Did you fall in love with--

08:02.830 --> 08:03.540
Shut up!

08:05.250 --> 08:07.710
What are you doing?!

08:07.710 --> 08:10.210
Men who talk too much are a pain.

08:10.210 --> 08:11.720
Sinbad!!!

08:19.350 --> 08:20.730
Maron! Maron!!!

08:26.650 --> 08:28.320
Maron, where are you?

08:43.540 --> 08:44.750
What happened?

08:58.140 --> 09:00.510
<i>Maron-chan? This is Mom.</i>

09:02.850 --> 09:06.940
<i>I'm sorry, but we've decided to get divorced.</i>

09:09.150 --> 09:12.570
<i>I...was left behind...</i>

09:14.200 --> 09:19.950
<i>I'll call again when we work out the details. Good bye.</i>

09:22.240 --> 09:26.830
<i>My parents went to foreign countries separately because of their jobs...</i>

09:26.830 --> 09:30.670
<i>...and I haven't seen or heard from them in years.</i>

09:31.130 --> 09:32.130
Maron!

09:46.140 --> 09:48.520
Maron! Maron!!!

09:54.650 --> 09:57.740
<i>Why am I searching for her so seriously?</i>

10:00.950 --> 10:04.250
<i>And what am I going to say when I finally find her?</i>

10:05.250 --> 10:08.920
<i>There's no way people can be together forever!</i>

10:18.630 --> 10:23.060
<i>I got close to her just to make her quit being a Kaitou...</i>

10:25.020 --> 10:28.140
<i>But I just can't stop being worried about her!</i>

10:28.140 --> 10:29.810
<i>What's gotten into me?!</i>

10:31.360 --> 10:33.980
Notice

10:31.360 --> 10:33.980
Don't go away!

10:31.360 --> 10:33.980
I'll return right after these messages!

10:31.360 --> 10:33.980
Kaitou Jeanne

10:34.900 --> 10:37.490
Notice

10:34.900 --> 10:37.490
I'm back to continue my adventures

10:34.900 --> 10:37.490
Kaitou Jeanne

10:46.290 --> 10:51.790
Why do I have to come along with you on your shopping trip?

10:53.420 --> 10:55.710
Because Chiaki isn't available.

10:55.710 --> 10:57.210
You're just a substitute.

10:57.210 --> 10:59.880
Just a substitute?!

10:59.880 --> 11:03.510
Is that all my existence means to you, Toudaiji-san?!

11:03.510 --> 11:04.810
My...

11:04.810 --> 11:07.810
Oh! Are you talking back to me?

11:09.020 --> 11:11.900
Don't you want to capture Sinbad as well?

11:11.900 --> 11:12.980
Yeah...

11:12.980 --> 11:15.190
Then hold these without complaining!

11:15.190 --> 11:16.110
Yes, ma'am...

11:16.730 --> 11:19.530
Huh? isn't that Nagoya-kun?

11:21.700 --> 11:22.700
Chiaki!

11:24.160 --> 11:26.120
What are you doing here?

11:29.210 --> 11:30.620
Divorce?!

11:31.710 --> 11:34.340
And where's Maron?

11:34.340 --> 11:35.630
I can't find her anywhere.

11:35.630 --> 11:37.500
You mean she's gone?

11:37.500 --> 11:41.430
Oh no! We have to report it to the police...

11:41.430 --> 11:45.720
Oh yeah! We should ask your dad, Toudaiji-san.

11:45.720 --> 11:48.720
Let's not create a situation just yet.

11:48.720 --> 11:52.310
Yeah, why don't we all go search for her, just the three of us?

11:52.310 --> 11:53.230
Yes.

12:24.220 --> 12:27.010
No... I couldn't find her. Not even at the train station.

12:27.010 --> 12:28.720
She wasn't at the yacht harbor, either.<i></i>

12:28.720 --> 12:31.930
I couldn't find her. There aren't any clues.

12:31.930 --> 12:35.440
Damn her. Where the hell did she go?

12:35.810 --> 12:38.770
Isn't there any other place she might be?

12:38.770 --> 12:41.990
To the best of my knowledge, no...

12:42.820 --> 12:44.030
I see...

12:45.610 --> 12:48.530
It's against the rules to be wandering about at a time like this.

12:48.530 --> 12:52.710
And it's a downright crime to make me worry!

12:52.710 --> 12:57.210
Maybe we should report it to the police after all...

12:59.000 --> 13:01.260
Let's go back. Maybe...

13:01.260 --> 13:05.510
Yeah, she might be home already.

13:06.220 --> 13:09.100
I'm going to give her a piece of my mind if I find here there!

13:13.430 --> 13:15.230
She wasn't at home, either...

13:20.520 --> 13:23.610
Should we let Dad know?

13:27.200 --> 13:28.320
This is...

13:31.410 --> 13:33.830
That's from our trip to the amusement park...

13:35.000 --> 13:36.620
Amusement park...

13:39.420 --> 13:44.720
<i>My Mom and Dad met in front of a merry-go-round.</i>

13:48.300 --> 13:50.050
I know! She's at the amusement park!

13:52.220 --> 13:54.980
But why the amusement park?

13:54.980 --> 13:57.440
What does that have to do with Maron?

13:57.440 --> 14:01.110
Why? It's because her parents first met...

14:02.230 --> 14:04.400
...in front of a merry-go-round.

14:04.400 --> 14:05.240
What?

14:07.700 --> 14:09.030
Didn't you know?

14:13.200 --> 14:15.830
I brought some tea for you.

14:15.830 --> 14:17.920
I'll leave it on top of the desk.

14:18.830 --> 14:20.420
Oh yeah, Mom!

14:20.420 --> 14:22.960
Do you know the amusement park where Maron's parents first met?

14:22.960 --> 14:24.000
Yes...

14:24.000 --> 14:26.130
I've been friends with Koron-chan since childhood.

14:26.130 --> 14:27.170
Koron-chan?

14:27.170 --> 14:28.930
The name of Maron's mother.

14:32.810 --> 14:33.760
Right there.

14:34.810 --> 14:37.020
It's a park now.

14:37.020 --> 14:38.100
Let's go.

14:39.520 --> 14:40.350
Wait.

14:42.730 --> 14:44.730
Chiaki should go alone.

14:47.530 --> 14:48.900
All right.

14:48.900 --> 14:53.620
What do you mean?! Don't leave me out of it!

14:53.620 --> 14:55.700
Is there something wrong with Maron-chan?

14:57.410 --> 14:58.620
It's raining...

15:08.720 --> 15:10.220
Please go find Maron.

15:10.220 --> 15:12.430
I understand. I promise I'll bring her back!

15:24.570 --> 15:28.400
Why? Why did you let Nagoya-kun go alone?

15:29.740 --> 15:34.120
Toudaiji-san, are you really worried about Kusakabe-san?

15:35.830 --> 15:40.210
If so, you would go no matter what!

15:41.330 --> 15:45.130
Just because you two are fighting all the time...

15:45.130 --> 15:46.130
Idiot!

15:46.130 --> 15:47.710
Idiot?!

15:47.710 --> 15:50.720
I'm calling you an idiot because you are one! Idiot!

15:55.930 --> 16:01.600
Chiaki is the first person Maron has talked to about her parents.

16:02.310 --> 16:06.650
That means Chiaki is the only person who can talk to her about it.

16:07.820 --> 16:14.990
Sympathetic words from someone she hasn't confided in...

16:16.030 --> 16:17.950
...won't persuade her to come home.

16:19.410 --> 16:20.910
Toudaiji-san...

16:20.910 --> 16:23.210
Now then! I have to get ready!

16:24.330 --> 16:26.130
Where are you going?

16:26.130 --> 16:28.840
I'm going to wait outside. Want to come along?

16:28.840 --> 16:30.340
O-Outside?

16:30.340 --> 16:33.630
Poor Maron shouldn't be the only one in the rain.

16:35.140 --> 16:38.310
Mom! Could you pour some hot tea to go?

16:38.310 --> 16:39.930
We're having a tea party tonight!

17:25.100 --> 17:26.100
Chiaki...

17:27.440 --> 17:29.020
I thought you were crying.

17:30.610 --> 17:32.730
Of course not!

17:35.820 --> 17:38.120
You know about the phone call, then...

17:38.120 --> 17:39.030
Yeah.

17:40.200 --> 17:47.000
You came here because you remembered my story about the merry-go-round, right?

17:47.000 --> 17:51.130
But I'm okay! I'm all right!

17:51.130 --> 17:54.210
This kind of thing doesn't get me down!

17:54.210 --> 17:55.800
Don't lie.

17:55.800 --> 17:57.800
Why did you come out here, then?

17:57.800 --> 18:02.560
Say Chiaki, why did you think I was crying?

18:04.310 --> 18:08.980
Because, Maron..you're very vulnerable.

18:25.830 --> 18:29.620
No! I said no! No, Chiaki!

18:29.620 --> 18:32.840
It hurts! Let me go!

18:32.840 --> 18:37.340
When you're sad... When you're hurt... It's okay to cry.

18:50.440 --> 18:54.320
I...I've always wanted to be courageous...

18:54.320 --> 18:56.820
Courageous enough to withstand being alone.

18:56.820 --> 18:59.610
To be able to show my true self.

18:59.610 --> 19:02.820
I wanted the courage to trust and rely on somebody else.

19:06.040 --> 19:10.210
I've known the addresses and phone numbers of my parents all along.

19:10.210 --> 19:15.210
I could have called, or sent letters, or even visited them if I had wanted.

19:17.340 --> 19:23.010
I was scared! I was scared of being told that I'm not wanted!

19:23.010 --> 19:28.770
I couldn't live on if I didn't tell myself I was strong!

19:29.810 --> 19:32.230
Please! Don't let me be alone!

19:34.310 --> 19:37.320
I don't want to be alone anymore.

19:41.910 --> 19:43.410
You're unfair, Maron.

19:46.830 --> 19:50.960
You're unable to fully trust anybody, even those who would protect you.

19:55.710 --> 19:59.050
If you're afraid to trust them, then just feel them in your heart.

19:59.050 --> 20:00.130
Feel...

20:00.130 --> 20:01.510
Your parents...

20:02.720 --> 20:05.300
...must have had a reason for divorcing.

20:05.300 --> 20:08.520
But it's not because they didn't want you anymore.

20:08.520 --> 20:10.730
Take courage from knowing that.

20:10.730 --> 20:12.730
Take courage from knowing that...

20:12.730 --> 20:17.900
With that courage, you will be able to trust others.

20:17.900 --> 20:23.530
When I learned about the Maron Dome, I really felt like I was loved.

20:23.530 --> 20:26.830
My heart was enveloped in warmth.

20:26.830 --> 20:30.120
I can trust that warmth, right?

20:30.120 --> 20:35.000
Yeah, you can. Actually, you aren't so loney after all.

20:36.130 --> 20:40.130
Miyako and the Class President are worried and are waiting for you.

20:54.730 --> 20:58.520
Don't worry. Maron-chan will come back.

20:58.520 --> 21:01.490
Yes, isn't she your best friend?

21:02.400 --> 21:04.910
You've got to trust your friends.

21:04.910 --> 21:05.820
Yes.

21:07.530 --> 21:09.620
Oh, they're back!

21:09.620 --> 21:11.540
Kusakabe-san!

21:13.410 --> 21:15.370
Miyako! Class President!

21:16.040 --> 21:17.330
Welcome back!

21:17.330 --> 21:18.210
I'm back!

21:19.210 --> 21:21.090
I'm so glad...

21:21.840 --> 21:25.130
Stupid Maron. I was so worried.

21:25.130 --> 21:27.510
Miyako...is that true?

21:27.510 --> 21:30.510
Of course not, blockhead!

21:30.510 --> 21:35.230
What were you doing until now?! You made everyone worry!

21:36.230 --> 21:39.230
Stop being so self-centered.

21:39.230 --> 21:43.360
Toudaiji-san, you don't need to be so harsh.

21:44.740 --> 21:47.410
I'm home, Miyako.

21:47.410 --> 21:52.580
<i>I'm so glad you came back safe, Maron.</i>

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:33.010 --> 23:37.520
I'm Toudaiji Miyako, sixteen years old.

23:37.520 --> 23:39.060
I'll study hard!

23:39.060 --> 23:41.810
For love... I'll do the same.

23:41.810 --> 23:46.400
Finally, I'm also the head of the Special Jeanne Task Force!

23:46.400 --> 23:49.740
But... Isn't there something missing?

23:49.740 --> 23:54.280
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Miyako Shoots Love and Friendship!

23:54.280 --> 23:59.330
Maron is not Kaitou Jeanne! I'll prove it to you all!
